# NOTE: keystore.properties, keystore/ and local.properties ARE committed on
# purpose: this repository is the private backup of the project and must be
# restorable on a fresh machine (including the release signing key).
#
# Published APKs are build artefacts and are NOT committed (they are ~141 MB,
# over GitHub's file limit). Rebuild them with build-dist.bat.
/dist/**/*.apk
/dist/**/*.idsig
.cloud-attachments/
